" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 16:43:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>2</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59556</s:story_id></item><item><title>Muller Hits Program Record Third Perfect Air Rifle in Win Over Georgia Southern</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/17/muller-hits-program-record-third-perfect-air-rifle-in-win-over-georgia-southern</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/17/muller-hits-program-record-third-perfect-air-rifle-in-win-over-georgia-southern</guid><category>Rifle</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Oceanne Muller takes aim during the first rifle match of the season" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/26/DSC07857.jpg" /><br /><br />STATESBORO, Ga. – The West Virginia University rifle notched its fifth straight win of the season, defeating Georgia Southern 4741-4728 on Saturday inside the Shooting Sports Education Center.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/26/DSC07857.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/26/DSC07857.jpg"><media:title>Oceanne Muller takes aim during the first rifle match of the season</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/26/DSC07857.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 16:41:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>8</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59555</s:story_id></item><item><title>West Virginia Heads Back to Florida for Battle with UCF</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/17/volleyball-west-virginia-heads-back-to-florida-for-battle-with-ucf</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/17/volleyball-west-virginia-heads-back-to-florida-for-battle-with-ucf</guid><category>Volleyball</cat